				<r3d:description language="eng">PQR is an online database of molecular properties predicted from quantum mechanics with integrated capabilities for molecular visualization and data sharing. ased on the number of molecules, PQR is currently the largest open database of molecular quantum calculations. PQR features interactive high-quality rendering of molecular structures and properties on computers, tablets, and cell phones and allows to efficiently share data via digital object identifiers (DOI) and scannable QR barcodes.</r3d:description>
